WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.440
Hey, bro.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:07.820
Okay. If you get hot way too easily,

00:00:07.821 --> 00:00:10.261
this little clip on fan is a summer must have.

00:00:10.262 --> 00:00:11.701
You just clip it onto your shirt

00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:14.481
and it blows cool air right toward your face.

00:00:14.482 --> 00:00:15.581
It has three speeds,

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.421
the angle is adjustable and the battery lasts a long time.

00:00:18.422 --> 00:00:20.381
It's perfect for games, walks,

00:00:20.382 --> 00:00:22.981
outdoor events or just surviving the summer heat.

00:00:22.982 --> 00:00:26.541
Super portable, hands free and honestly so refreshing.

00:00:26.542 --> 00:00:29.182
Check the cart and grab one before it gets hotter.
